00:33:30,210 --> 00:33:34,300

566
00:33:34,300 --> 00:33:37,780
So here, our loss function
would be pairwise.

567
00:33:37,780 --> 00:33:39,780
Yep.

568
00:33:39,780 --> 00:33:40,620
Yeah.

